{"id": "t113-054", "text": "Uncle James - 60th bday + 35th wedding anniv same wk, March 3 & March 8. Aunt Angela throwing one big party in between, the Sat, at the cricket club. cousins Ruby + Andre doing a slideshow, want old photos from me by end of Feb. James keeps saying he doesn't want a fuss, but Angela says he'd love a new set of golf clubs. buy a card for both + dig out the photos", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle James", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "60th bday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "35th wedding anniv", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 3", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 8", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aunt Angela", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in between", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sat", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cousins", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of Feb", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "James", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a new set of golf clubs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a card for both", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "dig out the photos", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
