{"id": "t113-058", "text": "Ayo & Zeynep - anniv dinner was Sat, he proposed at dessert!! she said yes. he'd been planning it since Feb apparently, her mum knew, ring was made by a jeweller friend in Istanbul. they're telling his family in Lagos next wk on a video call. wedding prob 2028, maybe two - one here, one in Turkey. send them something", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniv dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "proposed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since Feb"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "friend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next wk", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "video call", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "2028", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send them something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
